{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Once, mages shaped the world\u2014until fear turned us into prey. I fled, I hid, but magic leaves a mark. They found me, dragged me from exile, and cast me into the depths.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The whispers here speak of old powers, of horrors never meant to be freed. If I am to survive, I must be precise. Every spell, every artifact, and every choice matters.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Magic still lingers in the dark\u2026 but so does something else.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/9258b9388ddc046675e841cef186c61d.poster.avif?t=1757081437\" width=779 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/9258b9388ddc046675e841cef186c61d.webm?t=1757081437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/64335b5c534f2c894a6ad13c81cbdd01.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight your way through the hordes of monsters emerging from the underground.</i> <br><br>Obligated with an almost impossible task, you must <strong>descend into the catacombs</strong> of the desecrated temple to eliminate this calamity. <br><br>Your motivation? Getting your <strong>freedom back</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/0a665b109172ba088a8fbe07ce8cd46d.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/065bc49d6025f2b6d70966fffb6ca617.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Not only the arrangement of items is crucial, but backpack parts itself as well!</i> <br><br><br><strong>Tailor your backpack</strong> to your strategy, choosing which skills will ensure your survival. <br><strong>Unlock new backpack blocks</strong> and make your inventory even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/ad50e4fc60f78a63d423f1ebf17b0c6f.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/5f2af221b1607a34f1a9fc27a2615186.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=97 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The dungeon is a dangerous place. Luckily, you're also hazardous with a whole arsenal of spells.</i>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your starting rune</strong> and come down to face the monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn experience</strong> with each horror fallen and <strong>pick new spells</strong> as you level up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just <strong>mind your mana</strong>. You may be powerful, but magic is not an infinite resource.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/06d44fa1312ef5f6db7cf0dfa776b7f4.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/cccd8cb1fd7a5b6acc02b6cb7d3d8112.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=97 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some unfortunate souls fell here before you, trying to remedy monster plague. Let's not let their equipment go to waste.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up new items</strong> when you defeat tougher enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test new arrangements</strong> of the items to find the most lethal one; just be careful. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical artifacts tend to <strong>interact with each other</strong> and sometimes create something even more dangerous.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/84f32d7cc47190359635b64ed1e299a0.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/ab2b2298edd23fe3c632617ef1a7faa0.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use experience earned with each descent to <strong>develop your skills</strong> in the skill tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contrary to popular belief, <strong>magic also requires a lot of stamina</strong>. And strength. And speed. And\u2026 You probably get it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/3e1710adc9be32b99ea43129a4507484.avif?t=1757081437\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2990040?t=1757081437","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2990040?t=1757081437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/f9274414d2ccac3c7b1b4b0afcec6f323bce500f/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1757081437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/f9274414d2ccac3c7b1b4b0afcec6f323bce500f/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1757081437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Once, mages shaped the world\u2014until fear turned us into prey. I fled, I hid, but magic leaves a mark. They found me, dragged me from exile, and cast me into the depths.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The whispers here speak of old powers, of horrors never meant to be freed. If I am to survive, I must be precise. Every spell, every artifact, and every choice matters.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Magic still lingers in the dark\u2026 but so does something else.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/9258b9388ddc046675e